The Software Testing Engineer is a full-time, on-site role based in Indiranagar, Bangalore. This position focuses on ensuring software quality through&nbsp; automated testing, executing test cases, identifying and reporting bugs, and collaborating with development teams to deliver reliable software. &nbsp; 

Responsibilities

